English
Are you a driven Full Stack Engineer with a passion for software development? Do you enjoy tackling technical challenges and do you want to play a key role in the continued growth of an innovative SaaS platform? Then this opportunity at Bessy could be the perfect fit for you.
Let’s start with a small introduction. We’re Bessy, an enthusiastic and ambitious software company from the Netherlands with an office on Bonaire. Our platform helps companies in the field service industry work smarter, with less hassle and more joy. From automated scheduling and customer communication to job tracking; Bessy makes it all easier. We’d love to tell you more about us, but this vacancy isn’t about us… it’s about you!
As an experienced Full Stack Engineer, you’ll help us develop Bessy further, build new features and actively contribute to product development. You bring not only coding skills, but also knowledge of SaaS products and fresh, innovative ideas.
What’s in it for you? A sunny workplace on Bonaire, right by the beach overlooking Klein Bonaire. You’ll get to learn, grow, and flex your creativity in a team that’s all about sharing ideas and building cool stuff. Oh, and of course you’ll get to work with all the tools you need, plus join us for Caribbean team drinks and outings. Because for us, having fun at work matters.
What will you be doing?
We will define that together. Depending on your experience and expertise, you will be involved in:
Developing new features and functionalities for front-end and back-end;
Improving and optimizing existing parts of our platform;
Solving technical challenges related to performance and scalability;
Building innovative solutions for our users.
Who are you?
Looking for a 32-hour-per-week position;
Already living on Bonaire or planning to move here for at least a few months;
A degree at HBO level or higher;
Bringing at least 5 years of proven experience as a developer;
Skilled in at least some of the following: JavaScript, NodeJS, Docker, Python, OR tools, Go
